vardhanyāṃ vāripūritāyāṃ sasūtra vasanāyāṃ pūrvavat pāśupatāstraṃ tiṣṭvā । (l.2) oṃ hāṃ ananatāya namaḥ । anantāsanāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ mādhāraśaktaye namaḥ । aiśānyādyāgneya koṇeṣu (l.2) oṃ hāṃ aiśvaryāya namaḥ । vairāgyāya namaḥ ।
oṃ hāṃ jñānāya namaḥ । dharmāya namaḥ । (l.4) uttarādipūrvāntadikṣu oṃ hāṃ manaiśvaryāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ avairāgyāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ ajñānāya namaḥ । (l.5) oṃ hāṃ adharmāya namaḥ । niṛti īśānakeṇayoḥ adhaścandrāya namaḥ ।
oṃ hāṃ ūrdhvaścandrāya namaḥ । (l.6) madhye padmāya namaḥ । oṃ haṃ bījebhyo namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ karṇikāyai namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ kesarebhyo namaḥ । (p.12b, l.1) oṃ hāṃ dalebhyo namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ nālāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ aṅkurāya namaḥ । (l.2)
oṃ hāṃ astrāsanāya humphaṇṇamaḥ । oṃ hāṃ astramūrttaye humphaṇṇamaḥ ।
sūryakoṭi pratikāśaṃ pralayāṃbudha nisvanam । (l.2)
trayakṣaṃ nāgopavītañca caturvaktraṃ caturbhujam ॥
pradīptadaśanaprādipta bhūśmaśrumūrdhajam । (l.4)
śaktimudgaraśūlāsi hastaṃ candrārdhaśekharam ॥
evaṃ dhyātvā - oṃ śiṃ paṃ śuṃ huṃ phaṭ (l.5) pāśupadāstrāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ । ityāvāhya ।
oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ । oṃ klīṃ śirase huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ । (l.6) oṃ paṃ śikhāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ ।
oṃ śuṃ kavacāya huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ । oṃ huṃ netrebhyo huṃ phaṇṇamaḥ । (7.) oṃ phaṭ astrāya huṃphaṇṇamaḥ ।
ityaṅgaiḥ sakalīkṛtya āvāhanādi sarvopacāraiḥ (p.13a, l.1) ...tejobhirapasāritamaśeṣa vighnaṃ maṇḍapaṃ vibhāvya । aiśānyādi digsthitakalaśeṣu īśānakuṃbhe । (l.2) oṃ hāṃ triśūlāsanāya namaḥ । triśūlamūrttaye namaḥ -
triśūlapuruṣo divyo nabha...makalebaraḥ । (l.2) oṃ hāṃ triśūlābhaṃḍajya । uttarakumbhe kumbhe oṃ hāṃ gadāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ gadāmūrttaye namaḥ । gadāpita*prabhākanyāsu pijaghnastalā* (l.4) -oṃ hāṃ gadāyai namaḥ ।
vāyukoṇe kumbhe oṃ hāṃ dhvajāsanāya namaḥ । (l.5) oṃ hāṃ dhvajamūrttaye namaḥ । dhvajastu varuṇapito vyāpṛtāsyo mahābhujaḥ dhvajāya namaḥ । (p.13b, l.1) jya (sampūjya) । paścime oṃ hāṃ pāśāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ pāśamūrttaye namaḥ ।
pāśasaptaphaṇopetaṃ puruṣapyaśca (l.2) saṃyutaṃ oṃ hāṃ pāśāya namaḥ । jya । naiṛte oṃ hāṃ khaḍgāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ khaḍgamūrttaye namaḥ । khaḍgañca (l.2) puruśyāma śarīrakralocanaḥ । oṃ hāṃ khaḍgāya namaḥ । jya । dakṣiṇe oṃ hāṃ daṇḍāsanāya namaḥ ।
(l.4) oṃ hāṃ daṇḍamūrttaye namaḥ । daṇḍopi puruṣaḥ kṛṣṇevapulohita locanaḥ । oṃ hāṃ daṇḍāya namaḥ jya । āgneye (l.5) oṃ hāṃ śaktyāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ śaktimūrttaye namaḥ । śaktistu yoṣitākāro lohatā... । (l.6) oṃ hāṃ śaktaye namaḥ jya ।
pūrve oṃ hāṃ vajrāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ vajramūrtaye namaḥ । (p.14a, l.1) puruṣaḥ sthulaḥ karkaśolidravo...oṃ hāṃ vajrāya namaḥ । jya । naiṛte uttare (l.2) kumbhe oṃ hāṃ cakrāsanāya oṃ hāṃ cakramūrttaye namaḥ । śatāraṃ cakraṃ bhṛṃ mūrdhniṃ śakraṃ śyāmata (l.3) ...mān ।
oṃ hāṃ cakrāya namaḥ । īśānasyadakṣiṇa kumbhe oṃ hāṃ oṃ hāṃ padmāsanāya namaḥ । (l.4) oṃ hāṃ padmamūrttaye namaḥ । padmañcapuruṣaṃ divyaśuklāṅgaṃ śubhalocanam । (l.5) oṃ hāṃ padmāya namaḥjya । yūyaṃ digādhapāstra hi cāvadantiyeṣṭikarma ca tāvadvakṣata saṃbhūya śivājñā śrāvyatām ।
(p.14b, l.1) tataḥ sthaṇḍile tilākṣataiḥ kṛtāmbhojyai bhasma rājavirājate saptadhānyāsti te kumbhe (l.2) sarvaśobhāsite'thavā kuśa bhasma tile kṛtvā sthaṇḍalopari lakṣaṇaṃ astreṇa dvārapālādīn hṛdāsampūjayet ।
pūrvavan (t) madhye । ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ । anantāsanāya namaḥ । anantā... (l.3) koṇeṣu aiśvaryāya namaḥ vairāgyāya namaḥ jñānāya namaḥ dharmāya namaḥ । (l.4) oṃ uttarā...dikṣu anaiśvaryāya namaḥ avairāgyāya namaḥ ajñānāya namaḥ adharmāya namaḥ naiṛdīśānayoḥ ।
adaścadanāya namaḥ ūrdhvaścadanāya namaḥ madhye padmāya namaḥ bījebhyo namaḥ karṇikāyai namaḥ (p.15a, l.1) sa...bhyo namaḥ । dalebhyo namaḥ nālāya namaḥ aṅkurāya namaḥ kandāya namaḥ karṇikāyāmīśāne (l.2) manonmanyai namaḥ ।
īśānādi pūrvāntakesareṣu sarvabhūtadamanyai namaḥ balapramathanyai namaḥ (l.3) balavikaraṇyai namaḥ kalavikaraṇyai namaḥ kālyai namaḥ raudryai namaḥ (l.4) jyeṣṭhāyai namaḥ vāmāyai namaḥ । karṇikāmadhye śaktimaṇḍalāya namaḥ śaktimaṇḍalādhipataye namaḥ
(l.5) īśvarāyanamaḥ karṇikāgravṛtte vahnimaṇḍalāya namaḥ vahnimaṇḍalādhipataye rudrāya namaḥ । (l.6) kesarāgravṛtte somamaṇḍalāya namaḥ somamaṇḍalādhipataye namaḥ viṣṇave namaḥ (p.15b, l.1) dalāgravṛtte sūryamaṇḍalāya namaḥ ।
sūryamaṇḍalādhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ । tadupari (l.2) oṃ hāṃ śivāsanāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ śivamūrttaye namaḥ । pādādimūrdhāntaṃ । oṃ haṃ sadyojātamūrttaye namaḥ । (l.2) oṃ giṃ vāmadevaguhyāya namaḥ । oṃ huṃ aghoramūrttaye namaḥ । oṃ heṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāya namaḥ । iti vinyasya ।
(l.4) dhyāye...mukhetu kumbhaṃ puruṣaṃ padamāsanastaṃ śivaṃ raktaṃ pañcamukhāmbujam ।
daśabhujaṃ tryakṣañca (l.5) vaktraṃ pratidakṣeśūlaṃ paraśvathāsi kuliśabhityāvitam ॥
vāmato vahniṃ pāśamitikrameṇa (l.6) dadhataghaṇṭāṃ bhujaṃ tākuśam ।
oṃ hāṃ hauṃ vidyādehāya namaḥ । sadyojātādimukheṣu (p.16a, l.1) oṃ hauṃ netrebhyo namaḥ iti mukhapañcakanetreṣu vinyasya । puṣaapairañjalimāpūrya ।
mūlena śivamāvāhya । (l.2) āvāhana-sthāpana-sannidhāna-sannirodhanāni kṛtvā
svāmin sarvajagannātha yāvadantyamukhāntakam । (l.3)
tāvatvaṃ prītibhāvena ghaṭesmin sannidhirbhavā ॥
śambho svāmīn (l.4) tavājñataḥ krīyatesya mṛtasyatu antyeṣṭi tvat padaprāptaiyaprasīda parameśvarā ॥
(l.5) iti vijñāpya । svāgatārghyaṃ datvā hṛdayādikarāntasthāneṣu hṛdayādimantrān vinyasya । mūlenaikatvaṃ vidhāya ।
(l.6) astreṇa saṃrakṣya- kavacenāpradakṣiṇaṃ avakuṇṭhya - amṛtamūdrāṃ darśayitvā- vauṣaḍantamūlena (p.16b, l.1)
mahāmudrayāparamīkṛtya -pañcamukhī mudrayāpūrya pādyācamanārghyāṇi datvā । abhyaṅgodvarttana (l.2) nirmajjanādīni
snapanāṅgāṇi vibhāvya । arghyodabindunā saṃsnāpya sūkṣmavāsā (vāsasā) samṛjya । (l.3)
candana-akṣata-dūrvā-hema-kaupīna-mekhalopavītaṃ -kuṇḍalābharaṇa-vicitravastrāṇi- (l.4) manasābhaktyā nivedyā ।
puṣpāñjalitrayena oṃ hāṃ hauṃ ātmatatvādhipataye śivāya namaḥ । (l.5) oṃ hāṃ hauṃ vidyātatvādhipataye śivāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ hauṃ śivatatvādhipataye śivāya namaḥ ।
manorathamudrāṃ darśayet । (l.6) sadyojātādimantrān layāṅgamabhyarcya । bhogāṅgāni pūjayet । paścime sadyojātamūrttaye namaḥ । (p.17a, l.1) uttare vāmadevaguhyāya namaḥ ।
dakṣiṇe aghorahṛdayāya namaḥ । pūrve tatpuruṣavaktrāya namaḥ । īśāne īśānamūrdhāya namaḥ । (l.2) īśānasyottare hauṃ netrebhyo namaḥ । āgneyo hṛdayāya namaḥ । netrasyottare hīṃ śirase namaḥ ।
(l.2) naiṛte śikhāya namaḥ । vāyavye kavacāya namaḥ । uttarādī pūrvāntadikṣu astrañcābhyacyaitān । (l.4) śivavadāvāhanaṣṭyaṣṭabhiḥ saṃskāraiḥ saṃskṛtya । pūjayet ।
brahmaṇā saṅkara (śaṅkha) triśūla padma dhenu (l.5) mudrāṃ aṅgānāṃ namaskāramudrāṃ darśya । mūlena puṣpāñjaliṃ datvā । mahāmudrāṃ darśayitvā sarveṣāṃ (l.6) śivesāddhimaikyatvaṃ bhāvayet ।
tato dvitīyāvaraṇe īśānādi pūrvāntadikṣu śikhaṇḍine namaḥ - (7.) śrīkaṇṭhāya namaḥ- trimūrttaye namaḥ- ekarudrāya namaḥ- ekanetrāya namaḥ-śivottamāya namaḥ - (p.17b, l.1) sūkṣmāya namaḥ-anantāya namaḥ ।
tṛtīyāvaraṇe= caṇḍāya namaḥ - devyai namaḥ -skandāya namaḥ - vṛṣabhāya namaḥ - (l.2) vināyakāya namaḥ - bhṛṅgine namaḥ - mahākālāya namaḥ - nandine namaḥ ।
caturthāvaraṇe= īśānāya namaḥ - kuberāya namaḥ - (l.2) vāyave namaḥ - varuuṇāya namaḥ -niṛṛtaye namaḥ - yamāya namaḥ - agnaye namaḥ - indrāya namaḥ । (l.4)
pañcamāvaraṇe= trīśūlāya namaḥ - gadāya namaḥ - dhvajāya namaḥ - pāśāya namaḥ - khaḍgāya namaḥ - daṇḍāya namaḥ - śaktaye namaḥ (l.5) - vajrāya namaḥ - cakrāya namaḥ - padmāya namaḥ ।
eteṣāṃ pādyādibhiḥ sampūjya japāntaṃ abhyarcya । pūjyā । (6) kuṇḍāntikaṃ gatvā upaviśya । tatra anāmikāṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ nyastamūlena cakṣuṣā (p.18a, l.1 blank)
(p.18b, l.1) kuṇḍasya nirīkṣaṇaṃ śivamantreṇa prokṣaṇaṃ tāḍanena kuśaiḥ huṃphaḍantāstreṇābhyukṣaṇaṃ vauṣaḍantakavacena (l.2) khanana -avakīraṇa-pūraṇa-samīkiraṇa-secanaṃ- kuṭṭana -
sammārjana - samālepanāni khaḍgena kuśe vidhāya kuṇṭhya । paścimottara (l.2) yāmya pūrvamadhyeṣu । oṃ hāṃ nivṛttikalāyai namaḥ । oṃ hvīṃ pratiṣṭhākalāyai namaḥ । oṃ huṃ vidyākalāyai namaḥ ।
(l.4) oṃ hyaiṃ śāntikalāyai namaḥ । oṃ hauṃ śāntyatita kalāyai namaḥ ॥ kalāmayaṃ parikalpya (l.5) trīsūtryāstreṇāveṣṭyā । oṃ hāṃ kalāmayāya kuṇḍāya namaḥ ityabhyarcya ।
dakṣiṇāyataṃ (l.6) paścimāyataṃ vā tiryagreghayā saha rekhā catuṣṭayamubhayatra triśūla kṛti na kuśatrayeṇa vajrīkaraṇam (7.) pūrvottarāgrakaradvayena catuṣpadānyāsaṃ astreṇa kuṇḍasyābhyantare (p.19a, l.1) saṣṭedaṃḍātaiḥ kuśai...pāta vacena vidhāya madhye ।
kūrcarūpaṃ viṣcaraṃ oṃ hāṃ (l.2) vāgīśvarī-vāgīśvarāsanāya namaḥ । iti uktvā tasmin devīmāvāhayet vidvān vidhivat
viśvāmātaraṃ śyāmā*mṛtumatīṃ dhyātvā । sadvisomālyabhūṣaṇām । * (l.2)
prasannavadanāṃ padmapatrābhanayanatrayam ॥ iti dhyātvā (l.4)
oṃ hāṃ vāgīśvarivāgīśvaryai namaḥ gandhādibhirabhyarcya । araṇesū kāntādvija grahāsvagrahā dvā agniṃ mṛtpātre (l.5) tāṃbūpātre vā ānīyā ।
āgneyāṃ aiśānyāṃ naiṛtyāṃ vā nidhāya । agniśakalaṃ kravyādārthaṃ (l.6) astreṇa naiṛte nissārya । nirīkṣaṇādibhirviśodhya । oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ vahnimūrttaye namaḥ ।
(p.19b, l.1) iti bhūtāgniṃ gṛhītvā । hṛdayena kumbhakena nābhyagninā bindvagninā ca samyojya recakeṇa nissārya (l.2) oṃ hrūṃ vahnicaitanyāya namaḥ । iti pātraste agnau vinyasya ।
samhitayā sampūjya । (l.3) samrakṣa apradakṣiṇamavakuṇṭhya prāsādena vauṣaḍantena dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya ādāya kuṇḍasyopari (l.4) pradakṣiṇaṃ traparibhrāmya śivabījamiti dhyātvā
pitarā viśakkita śirasaudhyāyan vāgīśvari (l.5) garbhanāḍyāṃ nikṣipyamānaṃ vibhāvya । bhūmiṣṭa jānumūlena ātmasammukhaṃ nikṣipet । (p.20a, l.1)
tato nābhideśe hṛdasamūhyaparidhānasya saṃpratibhāvya । śaucācamanārthaṃ tevava binduṃ (l.2) hṛdā datvā kavacena sadindhanaiḥ ācchādya astreṇa prajvālyā oṃ hāṃ garbhāgnaye namaḥ । iti garbhāgniṃ (l.3) sampūjya ।
garbharakṣārthaṃ astrajapta darbhakaṅkaṇaṃ vevī vāmahaste hṛdābadhvā ।
garbhādhānāya (l.4) sadyojātenābhyarcya hṛdayenāhutitrayaṃ tilairhutvā ।
pumsavanārthaṃ tṛtīyemāsī vāmadevenābhyarcya (l.5) śirasāhuti trayaṃ tilaiḥ hutvā ।
binduvinikṣipya sīmantonayananimittaṃ ṣaṣṭhemāsyaghoreṇābhyarcya śikhāhuti trayaṃ tilaiḥ hutvā ।
śikhaivavaktrāṅgakalpanān niṣkṛtiñca vibhāvya । (l.6)
jananārthaṃ daśamemāsī purūṣeṇābhyarcya kavacenāhuti trayaṃ tilaiḥ hutvā ।
(p.20b, l.1) jātegarbhamalāpaha snānārthaṃ vahniṃ darbhādyaiḥ sandhīkṛtya devīhastastha darbhakaṅkaṇaṃ (l.2) munmucya svarṇabandhanaṃ devīkṛtaṃ dhyātvā hṛdābhyārcya sadyassūtakanivṛttaye kuṇḍamastrāmbhasā (l.3)
saṃsicya darbheṇa astreṇa tāḍya kavacenābhyukṣya vahnirakṣārthaṃ uttarādi mekhalāsu (l.4) dakṣiṇapaścimāgrāt darbhān astreṇāstīrya teṣu paridhī viṣṭarān tadvat saṃsthāpya । (l.5) vaktrāṇāṃ lālāpanodanāyā
agneḥ pṛṣṭaye ca mūlagrayoḥ ghṛtākatāpañca samidhaḥ khaḍgena saktu (l.6) paridhiṣu uttare oṃ hāṃ vāgīśvarāya namaḥ । dakṣiṇe rudrāya namaḥ । paścime viṣṇave namaḥ । pūrve brahmaṇe namaḥ । (l.7) viṣṭareṣu īśānādīn
saṃpūjya arghyayitvā bālakaṃ phālayiṣyatha iti śivājñāṃ śrāvayet । tataḥ sṛksṛvau (p.21a, l.1) kuśādurdhvaṃ vadanādhau gṛhītvā astreṇa samprokṣya kavacenābhyukṣyā-vakuṇṭhya agnau pratāpya (l.2)
bhrāmya kuśāgreṇa tadagraṃ saṃspṛśya punaḥ paribhrāmya madhyena madhyaṃ saṃspṛśya punaḥ paribhrāmya mūlena (l.3) mūlaṃ saṃspṛśya tayoḥ kuśaspṛṣṭapradeśeṣu śivavidyātmākhya tatvatrayaṃ rudra-viṣṇu-brahmākhyādiṣu (l.4)
saṃyutakramāt । śaṃbare vinyasya sṛciśakti sṛve śambhunnyastvā । varmaṇā triveṣṭitagrīvā (l.5) vāma manuśyadigbhāge kuśopari mūlena saṃstāpya ...dā saṃpūjayet । (l.6) atha gavyamājyamānīya
vīkṣaṇādibhirviśodhya svadeham brahmamayaṃ vicintyādāya kuṇḍasyorthaṃ apradakṣiṇa tridhā (7.) pratyāgnigocare tāpayitvā āgneyāṃ saṃsthāpya darbhāgreṇa grata bindumādāya (p.21b, l.1)
oṃ hāṃ brahmaṇe svāhā iti hutvā punaḥ viṣṇumayaṃ svadehaṃ dhyātvā । pradakṣiṇena (l.2) aiśānyaṃ adhiśritya kuśāgreṇājyabinduṃ oṃ hāṃ viṣṇave svāhā iti hutvā paryāsamūrttiṃ rudramayaṃ dhyātvā (l.3)
nābhau dhṛtvā oṃ huṃ rudrāya svāhetya ājyabinduṃ kuśāgreṇa juhuyāt । ityudvāsya pradaśamātraṃ darbhāgra (l.4) dvaya nirmitaṃ madhyagranthi pavitrakaṃ aṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ gṛhītvā astreṇājyaṃ agniṃ sumukhaṃ trayoplāvayet ।
(l.5) tatvadātmasumukhaṃ saṃsaplavanaṃ hṛdā kṛtvā tat pavitragranthiṃ munmucyā agnau kṣipet । hṛdābhimantrita dagdhadarbhollukaṃ (l.6) astreṇa ghṛtekṣiptvā । pavitratu tyātatapyaśāvastreṇa kṣipet ।
dīptenā... (l.7) darbheṇa kavacenanirajyāgnau kṣiptvā pareṇa dipetanāstreṇa sandīpyā । tatapyulkaṃ (p.22a, l.1) vahnau kṣipet । tataḥ prādeśamātra madhyagranthikuśadvayaṃ praṇavena gṛtamadhye nyastvā ।
dakṣiṇa vāma (l.2) krameṇa śuklakṛṣṇapakṣa dvayaṃ vitāhyāṃ dakṣiṇavāmamadhyabhāgeṣu piṅgaleḍā suṣumnā nāḍi (l.3) trayañca sañcityasavyabhāgā sṛveṇa । ājyamādāya oṃ hāṃ agnaye svāhā ।
ityagnidakṣiṇanetre vāma (l.4) bhāgādājyamādāyā । oṃ hāṃ somāya svāhetyagnivāmanetre madhyādādāya oṃ hāṃ agniṣomābhyāṃ svāhā । (l.5) ityagni madhyanetre oṃ hāṃ agnaye sviṣṭakṛte svāhā
ityagnivaktre (l.6) kiñcit hutvā śeṣaṃ ājyabhāgeṣu heti kṣipet । ājyaṃ samhitayābhimantrya saṃrakṣyā । (l.7) pradakṣiṇamavakuṇṭhyā । mūlena dhenumudrayā amṛtīkṛtya । mūlena sampūjya
bindukṣvepadhanyājya (p.22b l.1) śodhanaṃ kuryāt । tadanu oṃ hāṃ sadyojātāya svāhā । oṃ hiṃ vāmadevāya svāhā । (l.2) oṃ huṃ aghorāya svāhā । oṃ heṃ tatpuruṣāya svāhā । oṃ hoṃ īśānāya svāhā ।
(l.3) iti vaktrābhighāraṃ kuryāt । oṃ haṃ hiṃ sadyojāta vāmadevābhyāṃ svāhā । oṃ hiṃ huṃ vāmadeva (l.4) aghorābhyāṃ svāhā । oṃ huṃ heṃ aghora tatpuruṣābhyāṃ svāhā । oṃ heṃ hoṃ tatpuruṣa (l.5) īśānābhyāṃ svāhā ।
iti dvābhyāṃ sandhānaṃ kṛtvā । oṃ haṃ hiṃ huṃ heṃ hoṃ sadyojāta-vāmadeva (l.6) -aghora-tatpuruṣa-īśānebhyāṃ svāhā । iti agnito vāyuṃ gatayā niṛtīśānaṃ gatayā (p.23a, l.1) ghṛtā ityāgnivaktraikīkaraṇaṃ vidadhyāt ।
tato nāmakaraṇārthaṃ īśānenābhyarcyā । astreṇāhuti trayaṃ datvā । (l.2) śivāgnistu hatāśaneti nāmaṃ kṛtvā hṛdayena vāgiśīvāgiśvarābhyarcya । visṛjya । (l.3) kuṇḍamānaṃ yathābhilāṣitaṃ vaktraṃ parikalpya madhyajihvayāṃ ...myānta
saṃskārapūraṇārthaṃ vauṣaḍanta (l.4) mūlena pūrṇāṃ vidadhyāt । tadyathā sarpiṣāsṛcamāpūrya puṣkaro paryadhomukhaṃ sṛvaṃ hutvā । (l.5) tadagre puṣpaṃ datvā । vāmadakṣiṇa hastābhyāṃ śaṅkhavat saṃsaktābhyāṃ punasavyena saṃlagnautā (l.6)
... pādādha samapādaṃ samūtthāya arddhakayenābhyāṃ stīryag vidhāya sṛgagradṛṣṭi vauṣaḍantamūlamantramuccharan (l.7) vāmahastanāntaṃ (stanāntaṃ) sṛnmūlamānīya anudvijño yavapramāṇadhārayā samastaṃ ājyaṃ vahnau kṣipeta ।
(p.23b, l.1) iti pūrṇāṃ vidhāya । upaviśya ।
sitapadmāsanāsīnaṃ pañcavaktraṃ caturbhujam । lambakūrca prāhumūrttiṃ *jaṭāmaṇḍita śekharam ॥ * (l.2)
sṛkkamaṇḍadaṇḍākṣamālāvyagra karāṃbujam ।
itthamagniṃ dhyātvā
agnetvaṃ aiśvaraṃ tejaḥ *pāvanaṃ paramaṃ yataḥ । tasmāt tvadīya hṛtapadme saṃsthāpya tarpayāmyaham ॥ * (l.3)
iti prārthyānantaraṃ śeṣavigrahamadhya (l.4) nāḍyāṃ praviśya । pūrvavadagni hṛtpadme sāsanaṃ bhagavantaṃ śivaṃ sarvopacāreṇa (l.5) saṃpūjya āvaraṇamabhyarcya । oṃ hāṃ ādhāraśaktyādi oṃ hāṃ ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ ।
oṃ hāṃ (l.6) anantāsanāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ anantāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ aiśvaryāya namaḥ vairāgyāya namaḥ jñānāya namaḥ dharmāya namaḥ । anaiśvaryāya namaḥ avairāgyāya namaḥ (l.7) ajñānāya namaḥ adharmāya namaḥ ।
adaścadanāya namaḥ ūrdhvaścadanāya namaḥ । padmāya namaḥ bījebhyo namaḥ (p.24a, l.1) karṇikāyai namaḥ kesarebhyo namaḥ dalebhyo namaḥ nālāya namaḥ aṅkurāya namaḥ kandāya namaḥ karṇikāyā (l.2) mīśāne- manonmanyai namaḥ ।
īśānādi pūrvāntakesareṣu sarvabhūtadamanyai namaḥ balapramathanyai namaḥ (l.3) balavikaraṇyai namaḥ kalavikaraṇyai namaḥ kālyai namaḥ raudryai namaḥ jyeṣṭhāyai namaḥ vāmāyai namaḥ । karṇikāmadhye (l.4) śaktimaṇḍalāya namaḥ
śaktimaṇḍalādhipataye namaḥ īśvarāyanamaḥ karṇikāgravṛtte vahnimaṇḍalāya namaḥ vahnimaṇḍalādhipataye namaḥ (l.5) rudrāya namaḥ kesarāgravṛtte somamaṇḍalāya namaḥ somamaṇḍalādhipataye namaḥ viṣṇave namaḥ
dalāgravṛtte sūryamaṇḍalāya namaḥ । sūryamaṇḍalādhipataye (l.6) brahmaṇe namaḥ । tadupari śivāsanāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃśivamūrttaye namaḥ । sadyojātāya namaḥ (p.24b, l.1) vāmadevāya namaḥ । aghorāya namaḥ ।
tatpuruṣāya namaḥ । īśānāya namaḥ ।
madhyāt (dhye) kuṇḍagatāgni hṛdyanaline *padmāsanasthaṃ śivam । * (l.2)
ratnaṃ padmamukhāṃbujaṃ daśabhujaṃ tryakṣañca vaktraṃ prati ।
dakṣe śūlaparaśvathāsi kuliśābhi bhāvitaṃ *vāmato । * (l.2)
vahnipāśamiti krameṇa dadhataṃ ghaṇṭāṃbujaṃ cāṅkuśam ।
oṃ hāṃ hauṃ vidyādehāya namaḥ । (l.4) sadyojātādi mukheṣu oṃ hauṃ netrebhyo namaḥ । mūlena śivamāvāhya sthāpana sannidhānāni kṛtvā (l.5)
svāmin sarvajagannātha yāvat pūjāvasānakam ।
tāvatvaṃ prītibhāvene kuṇḍesmin sannidhī bhava ।
(l.6) iti vijñāpya । svāgatārghyaṃ datvā hṛdayādikārānta sthāneṣu hṛdayādi mantrān vinyasya । mūlenaikatvaṃ vidhāya । (p.25a, l.1) ...lodigbandhanaṃ apradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā prakṣaṇaṃ (saṃrakṣaṇa) avakuṇṭhya mūlenāmṛtamudrāṃ darśayitvā ।
(l.2) vauṣaḍanta mūlena mahāmudrāṃ surocya pañcamukhīmudrāṃ badhya sahṛdā namontena (l.2) pādayoḥ pādyaṃ svadhāntena īśānādi mukha (l.4) pañcakeṣu ācamanam । svāhāntena tathaiva śiraḥ pañcakeṣvarghyaṃ datvā । vauṣaḍantamūlena puṣpadūrvākṣatādi dadyāt ।
mānasābhiṣekaṃ kṛtvā । (l.5) arghyodaka bindunā saṃsnāpya । sūkṣma vāsanāsamṛjya । candana-akṣata-dūrvā-hema-kaupīna-mekhalopavītaṃ (l.6) -kuṇḍalābharaṇa-vicitravastrāṇi- manasābhaktyā ca nivedyā ।
puṣpāñjalitrayenābhyarcya (7.) manorathamudrāṃ darśayet । sadyojātādimantrān layāṅgamabhyarcya । bhogāṅgāni pūjayet । (p.25b, l.1) paścime sadyojātamūrttaye namaḥ । uttare vāmadevāya namaḥ । dakṣiṇe aghorāya namaḥ ।
pūrve tatpuruṣāya namaḥ (l.2) । īśāne īśānāya namaḥ । īśānasyottare hauṃ hṛdayāya (netrebhyo) namaḥ । (l.3) āgneyāṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ । netrasyottare hīṃ śirase namaḥ naiṛte śikhāya namaḥ । vāyavye kavacāya namaḥ ।
uttarādī pūrvāntadikṣu (l.4) astrañcābhyacyaitān । śivavadāvāhanaṣṭyaṣṭabhiḥ saṃskāraiḥ saṃskṛtya । pūjayet । brahmaṇā brahma (l.5) makara triśūla padma dhenu mudrāṃ aṅgānāṃ namaskāramudrāṃ darśya । mūlena puṣpāñjaliṃ datvā ।
mahāmudrāṃ darśayitvā sarveṣāṃ śivenasāddhimaikyatvaṃ (l.6) bhāvayet ।
tato dvitīyāvaraṇe īśānādi pūrvāntadikṣu śikhaṇḍine namaḥ - śrīkaṇṭhāya namaḥ- trimūrttaye namaḥ (p.26a, l.1) - ekarudrāya namaḥ- ekanetrāya namaḥ-śivottamāya namaḥ -sūkṣmāya namaḥ-anantāya namaḥ । (l.2)
tṛtīyāvaraṇe= caṇḍāya namaḥ - devyai namaḥ -skandāya namaḥ - vṛṣabhāya namaḥ - vināyakāya namaḥ - bhṛṅgine namaḥ - mahākālāya namaḥ - (l.2) nandine namaḥ ।
caturthāvaraṇe= īśānāya namaḥ - kuberāya namaḥ - vāyave namaḥ - varuuṇāya namaḥ - (l.4) niṛṛtaye namaḥ - yamāya namaḥ - agnaye namaḥ - indrāya namaḥ ।
pañcamāvaraṇe= (l.5) trīśūlāya namaḥ - gadāya namaḥ - dhvajāya namaḥ - pāśāya namaḥ - khaḍgāya namaḥ - daṇḍāya namaḥ - śaktaye namaḥ - vajrāya namaḥ - cakrāya namaḥ - (l.6) padmāya namaḥ ।
