(l.2) agnimātraviyogeṇa viśchinnāṃ ubhayakartṛ spadāndhyāyet । evaṃ kumbhayāgāgni śavaiḥ ātmanāsaha nāḍiṃ (l.3) sandhānatrayaṃ datvā sandhānārthaṃ mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā । mantratarpaṇārthaṃ mūlamantraṃ aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā ।
(l.4) pūrṇāṃ datvā । deśopādana kālāpādana durnimitta śānti sunnimittāpādana hetave (l.5) mūlenacatuśśataṃ yathāśaktihutvā mantratarpaṇa dipane vidadhyāt । (l.6) oṃ hāṃ hauṃ śivāya svāhā ।
oṃ hāṃ sadyojātamūrtaye svāhā । oṃ hiṃ vāmadeva guhyāya svāhā । (p.27al.1) oṃ huṃ aghora hṛdayāya svāhā । oṃ heṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāya svāhā । oṃ hoṃ īśānamūrdhāya svāhā । (l.2) oṃ hāṃ hṛdayāya svāhā ।
oṃ hīṃ śīrase svāhā । oṃ hūṃ śikhāyai svāhā । oṃ haiṃ kavacāya svāhā । (l.3) oṃ hauṃ netrebhya svāhā । oṃ haḥ astrāya svāhā । ityekaikāhutyā tarpaṇam । (l.4) oṃ hāṃ hauṃ śivāya humphaṭ ।
oṃ haṃ huṃ haṃ sadyojāta mūrttaye humphaṭ । oṃ haṃ hiṃ huṃ vāmadeva guhyāya humphaṭ । (l.5) oṃ haṃ huṃ huṃ aghora hṛdayāya humphaṭ । oṃ haṃ heṃ huṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāya humphaṭ । (l.6)
oṃ huṃ hoṃ huṃ īśānamūrdhāya humphaṭ । oṃ huṃ hāṃ huṃ hṛdayāya humphaṭ । oṃ huṃ hīṃ huṃ śīrase humphaṭ । (p.27b, l.1) oṃ huṃ hūṃ huṃ śikhāyai humaphaṭ । oṃ huṃ haiṃ huṃ kavacāya humphaṭ । (l.2)
oṃ huṃ hauṃ huṃ netrebhya humphaṭ । oṃ huṃ haḥ huṃ astrāya humphaṭ । ityāhuti trayeṇa dīpanam । pūrṇāṃ dadyāt । citāyāṃ madhye (l.2) pīta rajasā caturaśraṃ tadupari rakta rajasatrayamālikhya tayorupari
(l.4) idhmamagniśca sampūjya । citerāgneyādi koṇeṣu apasavyakrameṇa śuṣkakāṣṭha mayānūrdhva (l.5) malānadhomukhān sakṛdastrābhimantritān kilānikhinya pañcaraṃ...sūtreṇa kavaceṇāpradakṣiṇaṃ (l.6) āveṣṭya ।
