pūrvajātyana... । (l.2) yā yajñopavītaṃ kṛtvā । śuddhe vāsasī paridhāca gandhādyaiḥ alaṅkṛtyakuṇḍā... (l.4) pārśve apradakṣiṇaṃ kalpita kuśaviṣṭare niveśayet । atra vasare kuśādi nirmitadehaścet । (l.5) mṛtaka dīkṣāyāṃ sādhiparṣatriṃśatatvanyāsātmikaṃ kuryāt ।
