gale oṃ hāṃ īśvaratatvāya namaḥ । īśvaratatvādhipataye anantāya namaḥ । ... (l.5) oṃ hāṃ śuddhavidyātatvāya namaḥ । śuddhavidyātatvādhipataye maheśvarāya namaḥ । dakṣiṇapārśve oṃ hāṃ māyātatvāya namaḥ । (l.6) oṃ hāṃ māyātatvādhipataye gahaneśāya namaḥ ।
