(l.2) oṃ hāṃ vidyā tattavāya namaḥ vidyātatvādhipataye vedavijñānāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ rāgatatvāya namaḥ rāgatatvādhipataye (l.4) kāmadāya namaḥ । oṃ hāṃ puruṣatatvāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ puruṣatatvādhapataye sūkṣmadehāya namaḥ । (l.5) iti catuṣkamudare ।
pṛṣṭhavaṃśe oṃ hāṃ prakṛtitatvāya namaḥ prakṛtitatvādhipataye pradhānakāya namaḥ । (l.6) nābhimadhyāntare oṃ hāṃ guṇatatvāya namaḥ guṇatatvādhipataye tridehāya namaḥ । siṇdhiṣu oṃ hāṃ buddhitatvāya namaḥ (p.29b, l.1) buddhitatvādhipataye buddhāya namaḥ ।
oṃ hāṃ ahaṅkāratatvāya namaḥ । ahaṅkāratatvādhipataye ahaṅkṛtine namaḥ । (l.2) oṃ hāṃ manastatvāya namaḥ । manastatvādhipataye saṅkalpāya namaḥ । śrotre oṃ hāṃ śrotratatvāya namaḥ । (l.2) śrotratatvādhipataye vyomacāriṇe namaḥ ।
tvaci oṃ hāṃ tvaktatvāya namaḥ tvaktatvādhipataye sarvāṅgāya namaḥ । (l.4) cakṣuḥ oṃ hāṃ cakṣuscatatvāya namaḥ cakṣustatvādhipataye prakāśakāya namaḥ । jihvāyāṃ oṃ hāṃ jihvātatvāya namaḥ । (l.5) jihvātatvādhipataye mahāvaktrāya namaḥ ।
nāsikāyāṃ oṃ hāṃ nāsā tatvāya namaḥ । (6, ) nāsātatvādhipataye oṃ hāṃ vilumbakāya namaḥ । vaktre - oṃ hāṃ vākatatvāya namaḥ vāktatvādhipataye dundubhaye namaḥ । (p.30a, l.1) pāṇyoḥ- oṃ hāṃ pāṇitatvāya namaḥ pāṇitatvādhipataye sāmadāya namaḥ
