śabdau oṃ hāṃ śabdatatvāya namaḥ śabdatatvādhipataye (l.4) oṃ hāṃ sūkṣmanādāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ sparśatatvāya namaḥ sparśatatvādhipataye balavaktrāya namaḥ । (l.5) oṃ hāṃ rūpatatvāya namaḥ rūpatatvādhipataye bhānumate namaḥ ।
rasatatvāya namaḥ rasatatvādhipataye oṃ hāṃ jaladāya namaḥ । (l.6) gandhatatvāya namaḥ gandhatatvādhipataye oṃ hāṃ gandhāṅgāya namaḥ oṃ hāṃ vyomatatvāya namaḥ (p.30b, l.1) vyomatatvādhipataye sūkṣmāya namaḥ ।
vāyutatvāya namaḥ vāyutatvādhipataye mātariśvane namaḥ । (l.2) ātmayonyābhyantare pittasthāne agnitatvāya namaḥ agnitatvādhipataye tviṣāṃnidhaye namaḥ । (l.2) yonyotho jānumaṇḍalāvadhi jalatatvāya namaḥ jalatatvādhirataye jaleśāya namaḥ ।
jānvadhaḥ (l.4) pādaparyantaṃ pṛthvitatvāya namaḥ pṛthvītatvādhipataye śrīkaṇṭhāya namaḥ narakavātālādi (l.5) caturdaśabhuvanāntarbhaveneḍhaṃ vinyasya tatvanyāsadanantaraṃ nyāsakrameṇa pañca pañcāhutiḥ hutvā (p.31a, l.1)
gandhādibhirlaṅkṛtya tadrūpaṃ dhyātvā । tatasthatgatenataścarīṃ nirīkṣaṇādikarmacatuṣṭayena (l.2) sakṛtyadadedahaṃ dhāraṇādibhiḥ dehaṃ viśodhya । āplāvya । gandhapuṣpādinā hṛdayenāsanamabhyarcyā । (l.3)
tat hṛdayakamalakarṇikāyāṃ vāmadakṣiṇamadhyeṣu iḍāpiṅgalāsuṣumnā nāḍītrayañca saṅkalpya (l.4) tāsu vāmājyeṣṭhā raudrī iti śaktitrayaṃ ca sañcintya । dharmādharmau ca vinyaset । mṛtakaśarīre jīvanyāsārthaṃ
(l.5) praṇayocchāraṇena samutthitaṃ nādamuṣṭyā dvādaśāntaṃ nītvā tena nādenaikībhūtaṃ (p.31b, l.1) svasthaṃ svakarmānuguṇamitaḥ tato gacchantaṃ ātmānaṃ kalpya । nādaśaktijāla śaktijālikayaitva (l.2)
sarvatapṛsṛtayā vibhāvyā । ātmamantraṃ samastaṃ sūkṣmamucchārannādarūpātat janitridhā bhrāmya tadupari (l.3) taṃ ātmānaṃ āsanaṃ vibhāvya । taṃ ātmānaṃ sūkṣmasthūlakaṃ nyāsādyaṅguli saṃyojanāt । gṛhītvā (l.4)
sṛṇīmudrayā hṛnmantreṇa svahṛdaye samākṛṣaaya svamātmānaṃ vibhajyā ātmamantreṇa saṃhāramudrayā gṛhītvā । (l.5) prāṇapravāha vartmanāvinīrgatya dvādaśānte saṅgṛhyā । udbhavamudrayā tasya dehe niyojya kṣipet । (l.6)
tat sānnidhyārthṃ mūlenāhuti trayaṃ hutvā malapāśabhyo namaḥ vibhāvyāhuti trayaṃ datvā । māyāpāśebhyo namaḥ (p.32a, l.1) iti vibhāvya āhutitrayaṃ datvā । karmapāśebhyo namaḥ । vibhāvya āhuti trayaṃ hutvā ।
sadyādibrahmāṇi (l.2) vidyādeha netraṃśca vinyasya । adhvaśuddhiviṣaye pretādi kalāmantrān saṃhārakrameṇa vinyasya । (l.3) śivamaṅgāni vinyasya । caitanya sannidhānārthaṃ mūlena sahasraṃ -sahasramardhaṃ-śataṃ vā juhuyāt ।
tato (l.4) nāḍīsandhāya tat sānnidhyarthaṃ mūlena śatāhutitrayaṃ juhuyāt । tadanu ātmanaḥ savyadigbhāge maṇḍalaṃ (l.5) vidhāyā । tadupari śiṣyaṃ sanniveṣyā darbhamūlaṃ mūlamantreṇa śiṣyakaratale datvā tadagraṃ svajaṅghā
saṇdhau (l.6) sannidhetya kuśaścalena bisatantunibhāṃ śiṣyanāḍīṃ piṅgalayā vinisṛtya svanāḍyāṃ iḍayā (p.32b, l.1) praviśya vilīneti vibhāvya śivāṇunā recakeṇa praviśya (agnityā) śiṣyasya hṛdayaṃ tat pūrarakeṇa (l.2) praviśya
recakeṇa vinisṛtya svahṛdayaṃ pūrakeṇa praviśya evakumbhasthaṇḍila vahni śivaiḥ (l.3) iva nāḍiṃ sandhāya । tatsandhānārthaṃ pratyekaṃ āhuti trayaṃ juhuyāt । tat samayinaḥ sva ācāra vaikalya śuddhaye (l.4) mūlena sahasraṃ hutvā ।
agnimadhye sthitaṃ rudraṃ nīlakaṇṭhaṃ trilocanam ।
vyākhyāmudrānalaṃ jñānaṃ *śūlahastaṃ caturbhujaṃ ॥ * (l.5)
sarvālaṅaakāra saṃyuktaṃ sarvayajñopavītinam । - iti dhyātvā ātmānaṃ (l.6) bhū rūpade yojayet । pṛthivyādi tatvāni mantrasāsandhyajan śuddhavidyātatvaṃ śuddhasvarūpaṃ... (p.33a, l.1)
(ātmānaṃ vicintyā) bindunāmadheya māyātatvaṃ āsanaṃ vibhāvya । iṇḍikādi nādaśiro... (l.2) māna śaktireva antaḥ karaṇabhāvanāṃ kṛtvā । parameśvara dhyānaikacitta unmanā svarūpaṃ śivaṃ vibhāvya ।
(l.3) sakalīkaraṇa śuddhiyuktaṃ ācāryaṃ parame yojayet । viṣuvaṃ pūrṇāhuti (l.4) samaye śiṣyātmānaṃ svamanasaśca praṇavāyunā samāyogaṃ kṛtvā ।
iti prathamasaṃbandha (l.5) iti praṇaviṣuvaṃ mūlādhārāt utthita nādaātmanaścayeti yasvarūpaṃ bhāvanā iti dvitīyasaṃbandhaḥ । manuviṣṭayaṃ (l.6) nādotgamātnīda nāḍisamāyogena tṛtiyasaṃbandhaḥ ।
nāḍi viṣṭavaṃ akāra-ukāra- makāra-bindu-nāda- (p.33b, l.1) nādāntākhyaṃ-ṣaṭkalaya brahma-viṣṇu-rudra-īśvara-sadāśiva-anāhataśivaṃ- hṛtkaṇṭhatālu bhrūmadhya (l.2) bindu biladvāradaśānta sthāneṣu tattaddakṣa nānā layaṃ kṛtvā ।
saptamasthānastita śaktisthāne ātmānaṃ (l.3) bhūvikṣepeṇa kālaṃ layatveti caturthaṃ praśāntaviṣuvaṃ śaktimadhye nādākhyadhvaniḥ । (l.4) samanāntaṃ ūrdhvemeva prasaret । iti pañcamaśakti viṣuvaṃ śaktimārabhya samūliparyantaṃ (l.5) tridhākṛtvā ।
ṣoḍaśatruṭya kālena śaktyantocchāraṇeṇā parakālaṃ (l.6) saptadaśadruṭyātmakālena vyācintyantoccāreṇāt aparakālaṃ aṣṭādaśatruṭyātmakālena (p.34a, l.1) samanāntaṃ prāṇācārāt aparakālaḥ ।
evalayakāraṇāt kālaviṣuvaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ (l.2) tatonmanyante vidyamānabhūta śivasthānamātvyaktikārakākhya tatvaviṣuvaṃ saptakamiti bhāvanāmitvāt (l.3) unmanāśakteḥ apare niṣkale paraśiṣyātmakam śivasaṃyojayet ।
sṛkbhāvanāmitvāt (l.4) viṣuve śiṣyātmayojanārthaṃ pūrṇāhutimāha । sṛkdagdha eva suṣumnā nāḍīti vibhāvya sṛgvadi bila eva ... hṛtkamalamiti vibhāvyājya sāraṇyevāmṛtadhārāmayena bhāvanāṃ kṛtvā ।
