kumbhakayo..nāṣyotmānaṃ nidrādi padādhiṣṭāyakena śivena saṃyojayet । (l.3) sthairyārthaṃ ...pūrṇāhuti kṣipet । prāyaścittārthaṃ astreṇāṣṭādhikaśataṃ hutvā । (l.4) kumbhasthaṃ puṣpikayā saṃpūjya । parānmukhārghyaṃ datvā
