(p.35a, l.1) ājye svāhānte baliṃ datvā । viṣṭareṣu īśānādin saṃpūjya svāhānta baliṃ dadyāt । vahniṃ nirudhya (l.2) tataḥ svadakṣiṇadigbhāge maṇḍaladvayaṃ vipādya prathamamaṇḍale uttarādi pūrvāntadikṣu । yakṣebhyo namaḥ । (l.3) gaṇebhyo namaḥ ।
mātrabhyo namaḥ । rudrebhyo namaḥ । paryaniṛtyāgneyaiśānakoṇeṣu (l.4) nāgebhyo namaḥ । rākṣasebhyo namaḥ । asurebhyo namaḥ । grahebhyo namaḥ । maṇḍalamadhye (l.5) naiṛtyādneyaiśāneṣu viśvebhyo namaḥ । rāśibhyo namaḥ । nakṣatrebhayo namaḥ ।
vāyuvaruṇayormadhye (l.7) kṣetrapālakāya namaḥ । ityabhyarcya । svāhāntaṃ baliṃ dadyāt । dvitīye maṇḍale īśānādīn (p.35b, l.1) saṃpūjya । svāhānte baliṃ dadyāt । maṇḍape daśāyudhānāṃ pūjitakrameṇa parānmukhārghyaṃ datvā
(l.2) vardhaniṃ gatapāśupatāstreṇa saṃyojya nirudhya । tataśavaṃ dakṣiṇa mastakaṃ citāyāmāropya । (l.3) vastreṇāpasavyenāsādya candanādakāṣṭairapi dhāryamūrte haste tatsuto (l.4) varjya vo śiṣye vā susnātaḥ ।
