gotrayā śarmaṇe prati (ta) bhūta āsyataṇḍulaṃ dadāmi । (p.36a, l.1) āsyadeśe pitṛmantra sāñjaliṃ kṣipet । ājyo (ye) nāgniṃ prajvālya śirodeśe..thoya (l.2) sarpi madhu payaḥ sṛcimāpūrya ।
tvamagne dakṣiṇe kālaṃ kālonai..vāpapāteḥ (l.3) grahāṇa mantrasaṃpūtāṃ śāvyāmevāṃ mahāhuti pūrṇāṃ datvā sṛksṛvau citāyāmeva (l.4) kṣipet । vardhanīṃ vāmaskandhe'dhiropya । dhārāmayimavarṇatāṃ parānmukhitān (l.5) nikṣipya ।
