oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ svāhetyaṅkuśamudrayā tadvādaśāntaṃ nītvā tṛṇāgrabindu rūpaṃ jīvaṃ sañcintya । namontenātmamantreṇa saṃhāramudrayā saṅgrahya svanāḍyānitsārya putra saṃyogaṃ vibhāvya vāmayodbhavamudrayā ātmamantreṇa ।
