kalavikaraṇyai (l.4) namaḥ kālyai namaḥ raudryai namaḥ jyeṣṭhāyai namaḥ vāmāyai namaḥ । (l.5) karṇikāmadhye śaktimaṇḍalāya namaḥ śaktimaṇḍalādhipataye namaḥ (p.41a, l.1) īśvarāyanamaḥ karṇikāgravṛtte vahnimaṇḍalāya namaḥ
(l.2) vahnimaṇḍalādhipataye namaḥ rudrāya namaḥ kesarāgravṛtte somamaṇḍalāya (l.3) namaḥ somamaṇḍalādhipataye namaḥ viṣṇave namaḥ dalāgravṛtte (l.4) sūryamaṇḍalāya namaḥ । sūryamaṇḍalādhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ । (p.41b, l.1)
tadupari oṃ hāṃ nīlakaṇṭharudrāsanāya namaḥ । nīlakaṇṭharudramūrttaye namaḥ । (l.2) vāmādimūrdhānta sadyojāta vāmadevaṃ aghora tatpuruṣa īśāna mantrān vinyasya (l.3)
nīlakaṇṭhaṃ triṇetrañca jaṭāmakuṭaśobhitam । (l.4)
śūlaṃ kapālaṃ khaḍgañca abhayaṃ savyahastake ॥
nāgaṃ paraśu*daṇḍañca varadaṃ vāmahastake । * (l.5)
caturmukhāṣṭahastañca *śvetavarṇa virājitam ॥ * (p.42a, l.1)
sarvālaṅkārasaṃyuktaṃ sarvamaṇḍala maṇḍitam । (l.2)
iti dhyātvā । oṃ hāṃ hauṃ vidyādehāya namaḥ । sadyojātādimukheṣu (l.2) oṃ hāṃ hāṃ netrebhyo namaḥ puṣpaiḥ añjalimāpūrya ।॥



     

